abstract: "PathoImage Toolkit is an open-source desktop application for digital pathology and microscopy image workflows, including image visualization, ROI cropping, tiling, reconstruction, downsampling, multichannel image handling, OME-TIFF support, Leica LIF conversion, metadata preservation, and GeoJSON annotation workflows."
